"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ea9cbc7f8cc8654f\" href=\"?note=ea9cbc7f8cc8654f\" title=\"43-df-ce-traceable\">43-df-ce-traceable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"df08310d02ee0072\" href=\"?note=df08310d02ee0072\" title=\"43-df-hyperimmune-free\">43-df-hyperimmune-free</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"abd2ac3cf0e63c86\" href=\"?note=abd2ac3cf0e63c86\" title=\"43-df-computably-traceable\">43-df-computably-traceable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\mathrm{CETraceable}(A)\\land\\mathrm{HyperimmuneFree}(A))\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\mathrm{CETraceable}(A)\\land\\mathrm{HyperimmuneFree}(A))\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对f≤TA的c.e.迹，令到达函数记录f(n)首次入迹的阶段。此函数A可计算，由超免疫自由取可计算支配阶段，在该阶段截断c.e.迹得到规范可计算有限集迹；有限例外可硬编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce-traceable","status":"resolved","id":"ea9cbc7f8cc8654f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce-traceable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"df08310d02ee0072","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computably-traceable","status":"resolved","id":"abd2ac3cf0e63c86","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computably-traceable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce-traceable","status":"resolved","id":"ea9cbc7f8cc8654f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；见 [[43-df-ce-traceable]]、[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]、[[43-df-computably-traceable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"df08310d02ee0072","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；见 [[43-df-ce-traceable]]、[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]、[[43-df-computably-traceable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computably-traceable","status":"resolved","id":"abd2ac3cf0e63c86","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；见 [[43-df-ce-traceable]]、[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]、[[43-df-computably-traceable]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathrm{CETraceable}(A)\\land\\mathrm{HyperimmuneFree}(A))\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}(A).","display":true}],"bytes":1274,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-359","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-ce-traceable-hyperimmune-free]] — c.e. 可迹与超免疫自由合成可计算可迹"}],"outgoing":["ea9cbc7f8cc8654f","df08310d02ee0072","abd2ac3cf0e63c86"]}